i": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982617_252534300002512_88477822051553422_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a4rLFh-2ZeMQ7kNvwFp5t7k&_nc_oc=AdqZNnD-encJU7bAE6s0XlY_P5ITvUJCezzhIJ2xhdSYTuu416F8c611fQmyuioD02c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF-fL_7cjMPIeEBT9ImHNjd7AF0y-RJka4IPRxgfiOp0A&oe=6A8EE17D"}, {"file_name": "Zombieland_Office_Quest_2.png", "id": "637533130512612", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982535_637533133845945_4913826446620039560_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lxHdTaX5LvEQ7kNvwEImsfB&_nc_oc=Adpo3XUAYCJMTCTNGTecJ40uwpB9JrWzn-7AzXTtcWKAghBzdTrt5gsMSiIEQMTujd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGRxDvHo_FyyyAfrx3anQLMzEAIu03dl45UbaRpsaqyBg&oe=6A8ED662"}, {"file_name": "Zombieland_Family_Home_Quest_2.png", "id": "2864214510561781", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_2864214513895114_2819262369100977508_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9HFoeq6DWUYQ7kNvwFng_SO&_nc_oc=AdpXAWNPnwIpVFcygYIhvacoWE9hzY-SE0Z8Z3OL-I2RdJ967EYI4j_hU7_KUdutCtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQENt19MVn6tG2-Kqrid-MxLpOOabwXKUZ74-vPtF__jsQ&oe=6A8EE9D8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ZL_HSF_Meta_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1141846950667714", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393523_1141846954001047_2789278163877689417_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3zUrknd8xBEQ7kNvwFt4ePF&_nc_oc=AdrdaB0iYO2Tr63OqAOLLGUAE9twvfy1bf_V3EGxSbD-9XVBuqNK3sQxwTYDEKOWZ6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHQtV-fR0wIjNcmMpxOPIUPNGQWq4UO6zBjXNRs57bGgg&oe=6A8EF414"}, "display_name": "Zombieland: Headshot Fever", "keywords": ["Shooter", "FPS", "zombies", "Zombieland", "Arcade"], "long_description": "** VR Game of the Year finalist at TIGA Awards **\n** VR Game of the Year finalist at VR Awards **\n** Winner of 'Best Small Studio' at the TIGA Awards **\n\nThe award-winning Zombieland: Headshot Fever is an arcade light-gun game built for VR.\n\nThis zombie-killing race sport brings light-gun games into the 21st century! Headshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy.\n\nFEATURES:\n{958104066384162}\nBullet Time - Two headshots turn the world slow!\n{1132267338685310}\nLeaderboards - Challenge the world!\n{1038303291795263}\nWeapons - Unlock and upgrade a range of weapons!\n{609884205110187}\nThe Zombieland Invitational - The zombie-killing race course of your nightmares!\n{1794959568031203}\nArcade Mode - a new roguelite experience!\n\nAccolades:\n- \"Insanely addictive\" - VRFocus\n- \u201cThe gameplay is incredibly fun and really addictive\u201d - BMF VR\n- \"Arcade head blasting fun\" - Beardo Benjo\n- \u201cThe headshot slowmo is seriously addictive\u201d - Cerberusarms\n- \"A joy to play\u201d - Platinum Award, Thumb Culture", "short_description": "** VR Game of the Year finalist - VR Awards **\n** VR Game of the Year finalist - TIGA Awards **\n\n\"Insanely addictive\" - VRFocus\n\u201cThe gameplay is incredibly fun and really addictive\u201d - BMF VR\n\"Arcade head blasting fun\" - Beardo Benjo\n\nThe award-winning Zombieland: Headshot Fever is an arcade light gun game built for VR.\n\nHeadshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy."}]}, "developer_name": "XR Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xrgames.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Games / Sony Pictures Virtual Reality (SPVR)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zombielandvrgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2